{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c6bf6f76-db07-8e87-ac5c-3c6d6e0f672a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T14:30:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. My name is Bridget Lynch. I'm calling for my mother, who lives at 438 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. Her trash wasn't picked up today. Monday, the twenty-second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 438 Ruggles Avenue. And was today her regular pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Mondays. And I should be exact, it's the second miss in a row. Last Monday, the fifteenth, they skipped her too. She put the barrel out both mornings before seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So two Mondays in a row, the fifteenth and today. Got it. Is there anything near the barrel that might have kept the truck from stopping?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. There's a neighbor who dumps trash bags at the corner, right by her curb. Not her bags, to be clear. Someone from the next house over. I wonder if the crew sees the pile and just passes the whole stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, could be. Where exactly is the corner? Is it a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the corner just down from her house, across from the little corner store. That store has been run by the same family for decades, so you can't miss it. The bags are on the side nearest her driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the bags are at the corner by the store, close to 438 Ruggles. I'll put in a report for a missed pickup, both dates, and note the bags so a supervisor can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Should she leave the barrel out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, leave it out for now. Crews will try to come back to it. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0158. That's my cell, not hers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0158, and that's Bridget. Perfect. You're all set. We have the missed pickup on the fifteenth and today, the twenty-second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:29:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
